s=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Yes. I used to write down every single step of my favorite recipes. We would try them out with friends at school. We used to make such a mess!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        That's so cool. I was a picky eater as a kid. I thought cooking was boring, too.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Well, I'm glad that has changed. We wouldn't be best friends otherwise!", "time": "41600"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le01ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}